{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008","text":"紹誕於行己，不飾小節，然曠而有檢，通而不雜。與從子含等五人共居，撫恤如所同生。門人故吏思慕遺愛，行服墓次，畢三年者三十餘人。長子軫，有父風，早夭。以從孫翰襲封。成帝時追述紹忠，以翰為奉朝請。翰以無兄弟，自表還本宗。太元中，孝武帝詔曰：「褒德顯仁，哲王令典。故太尉、忠穆公執德高邈，在否彌宣，貞潔之風，義著千載。每念其事，愴然傷懷。忠貞之胤，蒸嘗宜遠，所以大明至節，崇獎名教。可訪其宗族，襲爵主祀。」於是復以翰孫曠為弋陽侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"紹","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"abd_10d_825","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"軫","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"翰","kind":"person","person_id":"n2x_d8l_n0d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"成帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"紹","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0089","start":89,"end":90,"surface":"翰","kind":"person","person_id":"n2x_d8l_n0d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p008:m0095","st